     "t": "code",
     "text": "import math\nimport torch\n\nmodel = torch.nn.Linear(10, 10)\nopt = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=1e-3, betas=(0.9, 0.98), weight_decay=0.1)\nwarmup, total = 100, 1000\ndef lr_lambda(step):\n    if step < warmup:\n        return step / warmup                                          # линейный разогрев\n    return 0.5 * (1 + math.cos(math.pi * (step - warmup) / (total - warmup)))  # косинус\nsched = torch.optim.lr_scheduler.LambdaLR(opt, lr_lambda)\n\nfor step in range(total):\n    if step in (0, 50, 100, 500, 999):\n        print(f'шаг {step:4d}: lr = {sched.get_last_lr()[0]:.2e}')\n    opt.step(); sched.step()",
